<title>USA: BOXING-DE LA HOYA WINS WBC WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-DE LA HOYA WINS WBC WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oscar de la Hoya scored a unanimous decision victory over Pernell Whitaker on Saturday to capture the World Boxing Council welterweight title.</p>
<p>Two judges scored the fight 116-110 for de la Hoya and the third judge had it 115-111 for the new champion.</p>
